.TH STAGERIG-PLUGIN-HOST 1 "October 2026" "StageRig" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
stagerig\-plugin\-host \- runs one plugin for StageRig
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B stagerig\-plugin\-host
.B \-\-serve
.I shm\-name socket\-fd
.br
.B stagerig\-plugin\-host
.B \-\-scan
.I format file
.SH DESCRIPTION
A helper started by
.BR StageRig (1),
not meant to be run by hand. With
.B \-\-serve
it loads a single plugin and exchanges audio with StageRig through shared
memory; with
.B \-\-scan
it probes a plugin file and prints its description, so that a plugin which
crashes while being scanned cannot take StageRig down.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR StageRig (1)
